WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.392
Guide three: pick your niche, or a

2
00:00:02.392 --> 00:00:04.081
channel you admire.

3
00:00:04.681 --> 00:00:05.910
Open Your channel.

4
00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:07.085
The first question is:

5
00:00:07.085 --> 00:00:08.543
how do you want to start?

6
00:00:08.543 --> 00:00:10.103
There are three ways in.

7
00:00:10.703 --> 00:00:12.616
One: type a topic you like, and

8
00:00:12.616 --> 00:00:14.637
click Research this topic.

9
00:00:15.237 --> 00:00:17.053
Your assistant checks the niche

10
00:00:17.053 --> 00:00:18.769
against six gates, using public

11
00:00:18.769 --> 00:00:20.761
YouTube data. Is it a real niche, or

12
00:00:20.761 --> 00:00:22.311
one topic that spiked?

13
00:00:22.311 --> 00:00:23.861
Is it still producing?

14
00:00:23.861 --> 00:00:25.743
Have newcomers won there, not just

15
00:00:25.743 --> 00:00:27.111
one big channel?

16
00:00:27.711 --> 00:00:29.472
Then: what did copycats get, what

17
00:00:29.472 --> 00:00:31.284
does the money really look like, and

18
00:00:31.284 --> 00:00:32.643
does your edge apply?

19
00:00:32.643 --> 00:00:34.001
You get a plain verdict:

20
00:00:34.001 --> 00:00:35.914
go, conditional, held, or no-go.

21
00:00:35.914 --> 00:00:37.222
It checks the topic.

22
00:00:37.222 --> 00:00:38.932
It can't promise results.

23
00:00:39.532 --> 00:00:41.213
Two: give one to three YouTube

24
00:00:41.213 --> 00:00:42.584
channels you admire.

25
00:00:42.584 --> 00:00:44.428
Your assistant studies their titles

26
00:00:44.428 --> 00:00:46.220
thumbnails and scripts, then makes

27
00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:47.379
yours different.

28
00:00:47.379 --> 00:00:48.847
Copies are refused.

29
00:00:49.447 --> 00:00:51.444
Three: bought the Done-for-you Niche

30
00:00:51.444 --> 00:00:53.395
Pack? Click Find my Niche Pack.

31
00:00:53.395 --> 00:00:55.653
Its niches are already researched.

32
00:00:56.253 --> 00:00:58.495
After that, the next questions come

33
00:00:58.495 --> 00:00:59.536
one at a time:

34
00:00:59.536 --> 00:01:01.740
the look, what fills the screen, the

35
00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:04.705
voice, the name, and how often you post.

36
00:01:05.305 --> 00:01:07.436
Next: ticking this week's topics.
